<title>NETHERLANDS: UNISOURCE SEES REVENUE GROWTH IN 1997.</title>
<headline>UNISOURCE SEES REVENUE GROWTH IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HOOFDDORP, Netherlands 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisource -- the telecoms joint venture grouping Dutch PTT , Telia of Sweden and Swiss Telecom PTT -- said on Tuesday it expected &quot;substantial growth in revenue&quot; in 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;This growth will be generated in the European market both from existing activities and from new activities such as other AT&amp;T and Unisource businesses being integrated,&quot; Unisource said in a statement accompanying its 1996 results.</p>
<p>Unisource added that it would seek to shorten the time it takes to bring new services to market.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
